message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Donghyunsim (동현심): a small city-building laboratory in the manner of SimCity DS, with the starting funds and the event/disaster switches set through the esoteric language Donghyun-lang"
type: software
version: "0.13"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24050245"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
